# microSD + status LED from Radxa ZERO 3E V1.2 sheet 19; the 40-pin header is NOT carried over.
# NEW for the Commander: eMMC (the 3E leaves the eMMC bank unpopulated), ID EEPROM, service header, buttons.
SHEET storage
# --- microSD (boot / recovery media): branch m2-hub moved the slot, its ESD diodes and supply parts to the hub
#     board (../commander_hub/src/netlist/35_microsd.net); the bus reaches it through the M.2 socket J41 ---
# --- eMMC 5.1: moved to 21_emmc.net (same sheet), shared with commander_cpu_ram ---
# --- status LED, service header (debug UART), recovery / reset buttons: moved to 23_service.net (same sheet) ---
# --- identity EEPROM (serial / MAC / OEM record, website requirement 15) on I2C2_M1 ---
U21 AT24C02 1=I2C2_SCL_M1 2=GND 3=I2C2_SDA_M1 4=VCC_3V3 5=EEPROM_WP
R405 10K VCC_3V3 EEPROM_WP
TP4 TP EEPROM_WP
C406 100nF VCC_3V3 GND
